essary, about a potential change of behavior.With the 2508 release, the setting will be removed from\",553\n\n\nOutput:\n", "role": "user"}], "parameters": {"model": "unsloth/Meta-Llama-3.1-8B-Instruct", "frequency_penalty": 0.0, "max_tokens": null, "n": 1, "presence_penalty": 0.0, "temperature": 0.0, "top_p": 1.0, "response_format": {"type": "json_object"}}}, "key": "chat_create_community_report_4e6f90f25068f7ef8f346b26390cb8667becb414f4bb1a964f37a00833ca635f_v2"}